  "details": "i want to be able to customize group permissions better and how one role interacts with another role. ill elaborate on what i am looking at\n\ni run a group with verfied and unverified users. i would like a bouncer role who can kick out users who have the unverified role ONLY. verified users can not be kicked by bouncers and only a user with moderator permissions can kick a user with verified role. \n\nas it stands now the verified role would need to be able to have kick perms to be unable to be kicked by bouncers. naturally since verified is just a regular user i do not want that.",
